        {
          "Content": "$\\text{象}$$\\text{山}$$\\text{几}$$\\text{乎}$$\\text{像}$$\\text{在}$$\\text{说}$$\\text{固}$$\\text{定}$$\\text{台}$$\\text{词}$$\\text{般}$$\\text{做}$$\\text{出}$$\\text{回}$$\\text{应}$$\\text{，}$$\\text{同}$$\\text{时}$$\\text{思}$$\\text{考}$$\\text{起}$$\\text{里}$$\\text{岛}$$\\text{的}$$\\text{症}$$\\text{状}$$\\text{。}$",
