        },
        {
          "Content": "$\\text{「}$$\\text{除}$$\\text{了}$$\\text{恶}$$\\text{魔}$$\\text{，}$$\\text{找}$$\\text{不}$$\\text{到}$$\\text{其}$$\\text{他}$$\\text{称}$$\\text{法}$$\\text{。}$$\\text{」}$",
