        },
        {
          "Content": "$\\text{象}$$\\text{山}$$\\text{不}$$\\text{论}$$\\text{是}$$\\text{施}$$\\text{压}$$\\text{或}$$\\text{让}$$\\text{步}$$\\text{，}$$\\text{和}$$\\text{泉}$$\\text{都}$$\\text{不}$$\\text{为}$$\\text{所}$$\\text{动}$$\\text{。}$",
